title: "IML BeeSenses: flowers as honeybees see them, for A Gift For People With Fear Of Honeybees"
type: software
version: v0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23111941
authors:
  - given-names: Hope
    family-names: Abeacan
    affiliation: Ion Music Live
    email: litejump@googlemail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/litejump-coder/Litejump-Coder-IML-BeeSenses"
abstract: >-
  ComfyUI nodes that show flowers as honeybees see them (UV, bee colours,
  receptor, bee's-eye, infrared and height-map views, with 3D reliefs and
  Gaussian splats), made for A Gift For People With Fear Of Honeybees, a
  gentle garden for people with a mild fear of honeybees on the Jupiter SR
  and in VR.
keywords:
  - honeybee vision
  - bee colour hexagon
  - ultraviolet
  - flower reflectance
  - ComfyUI
  - Gaussian splatting
  - fear of bees
